{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":57,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. To the tune of “Do Not Destroy.” A poem by David, when he fled from Saul, in the cave."},{"n":1,"text":"Be merciful to me, God, be merciful to me, for my soul takes refuge in you. Yes, in the shadow of your wings, I will take refuge, until disaster has passed.","tok":[{"t":"Be","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" merciful "},{"t":"to","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H6440"]},{"t":", God, "},{"t":"be","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" merciful "},{"t":"to","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H6440"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"for","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" soul takes refuge "},{"t":"in","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H6440"]},{"t":". Yes, "},{"t":"in","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" shadow "},{"t":"of","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" wings, "},{"t":"I","s":["H6440"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H4631"]},{"t":" take refuge, until disaster "},{"t":"has","s":["H7586"]},{"t":" passed."}]},{"n":2,"text":"I cry out to God Most High, to God who accomplishes my requests for me.","tok":[{"t":"I","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" cry "},{"t":"out","s":["H5674"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"to","s":["H5704"]},{"t":" God Most High, "},{"t":"to","s":["H5704"]},{"t":" God "},{"t":"who","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" accomplishes "},{"t":"my","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" requests "},{"t":"for","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"me","s":["H5315"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"He will send from heaven, and save me, he rebukes the one who is pursuing me. Selah. God will send out his loving kindness and his truth.","tok":[{"t":"He","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H7121"]},{"t":" send "},{"t":"from","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" heaven, "},{"t":"and","s":["H7121"]},{"t":" save "},{"t":"me","s":["H5921"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"he","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" rebukes "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" one "},{"t":"who","s":["H7121"]},{"t":" is pursuing "},{"t":"me","s":["H5921"]},{"t":". Selah. God "},{"t":"will","s":["H7121"]},{"t":" send "},{"t":"out","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"his","s":["H7121"]},{"t":" loving kindness "},{"t":"and","s":["H7121"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"his","s":["H7121"]},{"t":" truth."}]},{"n":4,"text":"My soul is among lions. I lie among those who are set on fire, even the sons of men, whose teeth are spears and arrows, and their tongue a sharp sword.","tok":[{"t":"My","s":["H7971"]},{"t":" soul "},{"t":"is","s":["H2617"]},{"t":" among lions. "},{"t":"I","s":["H7971"]},{"t":" lie among "},{"t":"those","s":["H3467"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"who","s":["H3467"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"are","s":["H8064"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"set","s":["H7971"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"on","s":["H7971"]},{"t":" fire, even "},{"t":"the","s":["H7971"]},{"t":" sons "},{"t":"of","s":["H8064"]},{"t":" men, whose teeth "},{"t":"are","s":["H8064"]},{"t":" spears "},{"t":"and","s":["H7971"]},{"t":" arrows, "},{"t":"and","s":["H7971"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"their","s":["H7971"]},{"t":" tongue "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" sharp sword."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Be exalted, God, above the heavens! Let your glory be above all the earth!","tok":[{"t":"Be","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" exalted, God, above "},{"t":"the","s":["H8432"]},{"t":" heavens! "},{"t":"Let","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H2719"]},{"t":" glory "},{"t":"be","s":["H1121"]},{"t":" above "},{"t":"all","s":["H7901"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8432"]},{"t":" earth!"}]},{"n":6,"text":"They have prepared a net for my steps. My soul is bowed down. They dig a pit before me. They fall into the middle of it themselves. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"They","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" prepared "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" net "},{"t":"for","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" steps. "},{"t":"My","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"soul","s":["H3519"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"is","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" bowed "},{"t":"down","s":["H5921"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"They","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" dig "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]